   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in the shared kernel; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| `Λ, d1, d2, nilp` | `{{2, 1, 0}, 8, 64, 2}` |\n| `distinct total weights, distinct one-site weights` | `{19, 7}` |\n| `diag G` | `{1, 1, 1, 2, 6, 9, 4, 9}` |\n| `pr, θ, θ12` | `{200, {2/7, -3/5}, 31/35}` |\n| `JJ gl(3) relations` | `True` |\n| `G unique, positive, invariant for all Ee[i,j]` | `True` |\n| `nilpotency: Ee[i,j]^(nilp+1) = 0 (i != j), Ee[1,3]^nilp != 0` | `True` |\n\n**[3,1,0] run**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| `Λ, d1, d2, nilp` | `{{3, 1, 0}, 15, 225, 3}` |\n| `distinct total weights, distinct one-site weights` | `{36, 12}` |\n| `diag G` | `{1, 1, 2, 3, 24, 32, 4, 12, 24, 64, 288, 576, 36, 128, 576}` |\n| `pr, θ, θ12` | `{200, {2/7, -3/5}, 31/35}` |\n| `JJ gl(3) relations` | `True` |\n| `G unique, positive, invariant for all Ee[i,j]` | `True` |\n| `nilpotency: Ee[i,j]^(nilp+1) = 0 (i != j), Ee[1,3]^nilp != 0` | `True` |",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
