   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in the shared kernel; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| `check` | `result` |\n| `expN = MatrixExp on root generators (exact, 3 test values)` | `True` |\n| `x0Of (factorized inverse) = x0 from Inverse[Pph1] (exact, z = (3/2,5/4,2/3))` | `True` |\n| `nMat3 = exp(r1 e12) exp(r2 e13) exp(r3 e23) (3x3, exact)` | `True` |\n| `OmegaD = e1 expN(r1 E12) expN(r2 E13) expN(r3 E23) (full matrices, exact, 2 points)` | `{True, True}` |\n| `rho multiplicative: e1 rho(n n'^-1) = (e1 rho(n)) rho(n'^-1) (exact)` | `True` |\n| `grid: 24 points, all directions distinct from phi_k and from each other` | `{24, True}` |\n\n**[3,1,0] run**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| `check` | `result` |\n| `expN = MatrixExp on root generators (exact, 3 test values)` | `True` |\n| `x0Of (factorized inverse) = x0 from Inverse[Pph1] (exact, z = (3/2,5/4,2/3))` | `True` |\n| `nMat3 = exp(r1 e12) exp(r2 e13) exp(r3 e23) (3x3, exact)` | `True` |\n| `OmegaD = e1 expN(r1 E12) expN(r2 E13) expN(r3 E23) (full matrices, exact, 2 points)` | `{True, True}` |\n| `rho multiplicative: e1 rho(n n'^-1) = (e1 rho(n)) rho(n'^-1) (exact)` | `True` |\n| `grid: 24 points, all directions distinct from phi_k and from each other` | `{24, True}` |",
