  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Task 1. Bra vacuum: eigencovector of S2, S3 with twist g' (four variants + control), one-site Gauss statement, x0G, eps-independence",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 1. Frames and the bra vacuum. gc = Lie-algebra companion matrix, PauxG its diagonaliser (rows (1, zeta_i - e1, zeta_i^2 - e1 zeta_i + e2)), g' = PauxG[zeta].gc[omega].PauxG[zeta]^-1 (variant V1); V2 = PauxG^-1.gc.PauxG, V3, V4 = transposes. Test: Omega (x) Omega = ΩD[zeta,omega] (x) ΩD[zeta,omega] is the exact left eigencovector of S2^(g')(u), S3^(g')(u) (twist g' placed as g_ij in the Lax matrix, ket-side operators on the right). Control: twist diag(omega). *)\nck = <||>;\ngc[zz_] := {{Total[zz], -(zz[[1]] zz[[2]] + zz[[1]] zz[[3]] + zz[[2]] zz[[3]]), Times @@ zz}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nPauxG[zz_] := With[{e1s = Total[zz], e2s = zz[[1]] zz[[2]] + zz[[1]] zz[[3]] + zz[[2]] zz[[3]]}, Table[{1, zz[[i]] - e1s, zz[[i]]^2 - e1s zz[[i]] + e2s}, {i, 3}]];\ngpVar[1][zz_, ww_] := PauxG[zz] . gc[ww] . Inverse[PauxG[zz]];\ngpVar[2][zz_, ww_] := Inverse[PauxG[zz]] . gc[ww] . PauxG[zz];\ngpVar[3][zz_, ww_] := Transpose[gpVar[1][zz, ww]];\ngpVar[4][zz_, ww_] := Transpose[gpVar[2][zz, ww]];\ngpVar[5][zz_, ww_] := DiagonalMatrix[ww];\nck[\"PauxG gc PauxG^-1 = diag(zeta) (exact, P and P')\"] = {PauxG[zP] . gc[zP] . Inverse[PauxG[zP]] === DiagonalMatrix[zP], PauxG[zQ] . gc[zQ] . Inverse[PauxG[zQ]] === DiagonalMatrix[zQ]};\nOm2[zz_, ww_] := kron[ΩD[zz, ww[[1 ;; 2]]], ΩD[zz, ww[[1 ;; 2]]]];\neigTestG[g_, zz_, ww_, uu_] := Module[{O2 = Om2[zz, ww]}, Table[With[{c = O2 . Sk[k][g, thN, uu]}, {Union[Flatten[c - (c[[1]]/O2[[1]]) O2]] === {0}, c[[1]]/O2[[1]]}], {k, {2, 3}}]];\nptsT = {{\"P\", zP, wP}, {\"P'\", zQ, wQ}, {\"regime eps=1e-6, dir (phi, (3/4,-1/5))\", 10^-6 phiP, 10^-6 {3/4, -1/5, 5/13}}};\n{tEig, eigTab} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[{p[[1]], Table[Flatten[Table[eigTestG[gpVar[v][p[[2]], p[[3]]], p[[2]], p[[3]], uu][[All, 1]], {uu, {u0, u1}}]], {v, 5}]}, {p, ptsT}]];\nck[\"Omega(x)Omega left eigencovector of {S2(u0), S3(u0), S2(u1), S3(u1)}: variants V1..V5 (V5 = diag(omega) control), at P, P', regime pt\"] = eigTab;\n(* one-site statement: M = rows = left eigenvectors of g' ordered omega_1..3, first entry 1, M g' M^-1 = diag(omega); M = L D U (LU without pivoting); e1 rho(U) parallel to ΩD[zeta,omega]. *)\nuOfLDU[M_] := Module[{s22}, s22 = M[[2, 2]] - M[[2, 1]] M[[1, 2]]/M[[1, 1]]; {{{1, M[[1, 2]]/M[[1, 1]], M[[1, 3]]/M[[1, 1]]}, {0, 1, (M[[2, 3]] - M[[2, 1]] M[[1, 3]]/M[[1, 1]])/s22}, {0, 0, 1}}, s22}];\noneSite[v_, zz_, ww_] := Module[{gp = gpVar[v][zz, ww], M, om = ΩD[zz, ww[[1 ;; 2]]], Xs},\n  M = Table[With[{ns = First[NullSpace[Transpose[gp] - ww[[i]] IdentityMatrix[3]]]}, ns/ns[[1]]], {i, 3}];\n  Xs = {M, Inverse[M], Transpose[M], Transpose[Inverse[M]]};\n  {M . gp . Inverse[M] === DiagonalMatrix[ww], Table[With[{cov = e1 . rhoU[uOfLDU[X][[1]]]}, {MatrixRank[{cov, om}] == 1, cov === om}], {X, Xs}]}];\nck[\"one-site (variant V1, P and P'): {M g' M^-1 = diag(omega), {for X = M, M^-1, M^T, M^-T: {e1 rho(U_X) parallel to OmegaD, equal}}}\"] = {oneSite[1, zP, wP], oneSite[1, zQ, wQ]};\nPphys3[zv_] := MatrixExp[rVec[zv][[1]] e3[3, 2]] . MatrixExp[rVec[zv][[2]] e3[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[rVec[zv][[3]] e3[2, 1]] . DiagonalMatrix[sVec[zv]] . MatrixExp[(1/zv[[1]]) e3[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[-(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) e3[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) e3[2, 3]];\n(* relation of the defining-rep image Pphys3 (reference Gauss factorisation, z -> zeta) to PauxG *)\nck[\"Pphys3[zeta] vs PauxG: = PauxG^-1 up to row/column scaling? ranks of ratio; exact equalities {Pphys3 == PauxG^-1, Pphys3 == Transpose[PauxG^-1], Pphys3 == PauxG, Pphys3 == Transpose[PauxG]}\"] = With[{P3 = Pphys3[zP], PA = PauxG[zP]}, {P3 === Inverse[PA], P3 === Transpose[Inverse[PA]], P3 === PA, P3 === Transpose[PA]}];\n(* companion-frame vacuum x0G = x0Of[zeta] (factorised inverse of the rep image of the Gauss-factorised matrix) at P: the XXX construction with z -> zeta; recorded *)\nx0G = x0Of[zP];\nck[\"x0G = x0Of[zeta] at P: nonzero, number of nonzero components of 64\"] = {Length[x0G], Count[x0G, Except[0]]};\n(* degree-0 homogeneity: ΩD[eps zeta, eps omega] = ΩD[zeta, omega] exactly *)\nck[\"ΩD[eps phi, eps omega] == ΩD[phi, omega] exactly (eps = 10^-6, 3, 1/7; 4 grid points)\"] = Table[ΩD[ee phiP, ee omGrid[[k, 1]]] === ΩD[phiP, omGrid[[k, 1]]], {ee, {10^-6, 3, 1/7}}, {k, {1, 7, 13, 24}}];\nck[\"undone covector phiUof[eps phi, eps om, eps om'] == phiUof[phi, om, om'] exactly\"] = Table[phiUof[ee phiP, ee omGrid[[k, 1]], ee omGrid[[k, 2]]] === phiUof[phiP, omGrid[[k, 1]], omGrid[[k, 2]]], {ee, {10^-6, 3}}, {k, {1, 7, 13, 24}}];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s), eigencovector tests\", tEig}}, List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
