  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in the shared kernel; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| `time (s), eigencovector tests` | `0.4554231` |\n| `PauxG gc PauxG^-1 = diag(zeta) (exact, P and P')` | `{True, True}` |\n| `Omega(x)Omega left eigencovector of {S2(u0), S3(u0), S2(u1), S3(u1)}: variants V1..V5 (V5 = diag(omega) control), at P, P', regime pt` | `{{\"P\", {{True, True, True, True}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}}}, {\"P'\", {{True, True, True, True}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}}}, {\"regime eps=1e-6, dir (phi, (3/4,-1/5))\", {{True, True, True, True}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}}}}` |\n| `one-site (variant V1, P and P'): {M g' M^-1 = diag(omega), {for X = M, M^-1, M^T, M^-T: {e1 rho(U_X) parallel to OmegaD, equal}}}` | `{{True, {{False, False}, {False, False}, {False, False}, {True, True}}}, {True, {{False, False}, {False, False}, {False, False}, {True, True}}}}` |\n| `Pphys3[zeta] vs PauxG: = PauxG^-1 up to row/column scaling? ranks of ratio; exact equalities {Pphys3 == PauxG^-1, Pphys3 == Transpose[PauxG^-1], Pphys3 == PauxG, Pphys3 == Transpose[PauxG]}` | `{False, True, False, False}` |\n| `x0G = x0Of[zeta] at P: nonzero, number of nonzero components of 64` | `{64, 64}` |\n| `ΩD[eps phi, eps omega] == ΩD[phi, omega] exactly (eps = 10^-6, 3, 1/7; 4 grid points)` | `{{True, True, True, True}, {True, True, True, True}, {True, True, True, True}}` |\n| `undone covector phiUof[eps phi, eps om, eps om'] == phiUof[phi, om, om'] exactly` | `{{True, True, True, True}, {True, True, True, True}}` |\n\n**[3,1,0] run**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| `time (s), eigencovector tests` | `0.700882` |\n| `PauxG gc PauxG^-1 = diag(zeta) (exact, P and P')` | `{True, True}` |\n| `Omega(x)Omega left eigencovector of {S2(u0), S3(u0), S2(u1), S3(u1)}: variants V1..V5 (V5 = diag(omega) control), at P, P', regime pt` | `{{\"P\", {{True, True, True, True}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}}}, {\"P'\", {{True, True, True, True}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}}}, {\"regime eps=1e-6, dir (phi, (3/4,-1/5))\", {{True, True, True, True}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}}}}` |\n| `one-site (variant V1, P and P'): {M g' M^-1 = diag(omega), {for X = M, M^-1, M^T, M^-T: {e1 rho(U_X) parallel to OmegaD, equal}}}` | `{{True, {{False, False}, {False, False}, {False, False}, {True, True}}}, {True, {{False, False}, {False, False}, {False, False}, {True, True}}}}` |\n| `Pphys3[zeta] vs PauxG: = PauxG^-1 up to row/column scaling? ranks of ratio; exact equalities {Pphys3 == PauxG^-1, Pphys3 == Transpose[PauxG^-1], Pphys3 == PauxG, Pphys3 == Transpose[PauxG]}` | `{False, True, False, False}` |\n| `x0G = x0Of[zeta] at P: nonzero, number of nonzero components of 64` | `{225, 225}` |\n| `ΩD[eps phi, eps omega] == ΩD[phi, omega] exactly (eps = 10^-6, 3, 1/7; 4 grid points)` | `{{True, True, True, True}, {True, True, True, True}, {True, True, True, True}}` |\n| `undone covector phiUof[eps phi, eps om, eps om'] == phiUof[phi, om, om'] exactly` | `{{True, True, True, True}, {True, True, True, True}}` |",
