  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 4(a),(b). The two-vacua covector Phi = ΩD[zeta,omega] (x) ΩD[zeta,omega']. (a) EXACT undo on all HW kets h: <Phi|h> = <e1 rho(n(zeta,omega) n(zeta,omega')^-1) (x) e1|h> at P, P', two more generic points and four regime points; the naive e1 (x) e1 pairing is the control. (b) The undone unipotent n' = [[1,a',b'],[0,1,c'],[0,0,1]] = exp(a' e12) exp(g' e13) exp(c' e23), g' = b' - a'c', is an exact rational function of (zeta, omega, omega') homogeneous of degree 0, hence eps-free in the regime: closed forms in (phi, omega-hat, omega'-hat) (Factor), compared with the XXX leading coefficients, Jacobian rank of (o1,o2,p1,p2) -> (a',c',g'), per-weight ranks of phi_u over the 24-point grid, and the controls. *)\nck = <||>;\nundoPts = {{zP, wP[[1 ;; 2]], wpP[[1 ;; 2]]}, {zQ, wQ[[1 ;; 2]], {-2, 9/5}}, {{-1, 7/3, 1/2}, {-3/2, 4/5}, {3, -5/7}}, {{2, 5/3, -1/2}, {3, 7/3}, {-2, 11/4}}};\nundoPts = Join[undoPts, Table[{eps phiP, eps omGrid[[k, 1]], eps omGrid[[k, 2]]}, {eps, {10^-6, 4 10^-6}}, {k, {1, 17}}] // Flatten[#, 1] &, {{10^-6 phiC, 10^-6 {-5/3, 5/3}, 10^-6 {7/2, -3/4}}}];\nundoTest[p_] := Module[{zz = p[[1]], w = p[[2]], wp = p[[3]], lhs, rhs, wrong},\n  lhs = kron[ΩD[zz, w], ΩD[zz, wp]]; rhs = kron[phiUof[zz, w, wp], e1]; wrong = kron[ΩD[zz, w], e1];\n  {And @@ (lhs . # === rhs . # & /@ u12HW), Or @@ (lhs . # =!= wrong . # & /@ u12HW)}];\n{tUndo, undoRes} = AbsoluteTiming[undoTest /@ undoPts];\nck[\"(a) exact undo on all HW kets at 9 points (P, P', 2 generic, 5 regime): {all equal, naive control differs}\"] = {Length[undoPts], undoRes};\n(* (b) symbolic closed forms *)\nsymZ = {f1, f2, f3};\n{tSym, parMain} = AbsoluteTiming[Map[Factor, (With[{np = Map[Together, nPrime[symZ, {o1, o2}, {p1, p2}], {2}]}, {np[[1, 2]], np[[2, 3]], Together[np[[1, 3]] - np[[1, 2]] np[[2, 3]]]}])]];\n{aS, cS, gS} = parMain;\nxxxA = -(((-f1 + f2) (o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1) (f2 - p1)));\nxxxC = ((f1 - f3) (f2 - f3) (f2 f3 o1 + f2 f3 o2 - f2 o1 o2 - f3 o1 o2 - f2 f3 p1 + o1 o2 p1 - f2 f3 p2 + o1 o2 p2 + f2 p1 p2 + f3 p1 p2 - o1 p1 p2 - o2 p1 p2))/((f1 - f2) (f3 - o1) (f3 - o2) (f3 - p1) (f3 - p2));\nxxxG = ((-f1 + f3) (-f2 + f3) (o1 - p1) (o2 - p1))/((f3 - o1) (f3 - o2) (f3 - p1) (-f2 + p1));\nck[\"(b) a', c', g' of n' (exact, symbolic; the Gaudin vacua are eps-free, so these ARE the leading coefficients) equal the XXX leading coefficients a'0, c'0, g'0 (exact difference = 0)\"] = {Simplify[aS - xxxA] === 0, Simplify[cS - xxxC] === 0, Simplify[gS - xxxG] === 0};\nck[\"T1 dependence: g' independent of omega2'; a' independent of omega2, omega2'; c' depends on all four\"] = {D[gS, p2] === 0, D[aS, o2] === 0 && D[aS, p2] === 0, And @@ (D[cS, #] =!= 0 & /@ {o1, o2, p1, p2})};\njac = D[{aS, cS, gS}, {{o1, o2, p1, p2}}];\nrankPts = {{f1 -> 1/3, f2 -> -2/7, f3 -> 5/11, o1 -> 3/4, o2 -> -1/5, p1 -> -12/5, p2 -> 1/8}, {f1 -> 1/3, f2 -> -2/7, f3 -> 5/11, o1 -> -5/3, o2 -> 9/7, p1 -> 7/2, p2 -> -3/4}, {f1 -> -2/5, f2 -> 3/8, f3 -> 7/11, o1 -> 5/7, o2 -> -11/3, p1 -> 2/9, p2 -> 13/4}};\nck[\"(b) rank of the Jacobian of (om1, om2, om1', om2') -> (a', c', g') at 3 generic points\"] = Table[MatrixRank[jac /. pt], {pt, rankPts}];\n(* controls: omega' = omega; common omega1' = omega1; common omega2' = omega2 *)\nsymAt[wS_, wpS_] := Module[{np = Map[Together, nPrime[symZ, wS, wpS], {2}]}, {np[[1, 2]], np[[2, 3]], Together[np[[1, 3]] - np[[1, 2]] np[[2, 3]]]}];\nck[\"controls: omega' = omega gives n' = 1 exactly; common omega1' = omega1: a' = g' = 0, c' != 0; common omega2' = omega2: (a', g' != 0)\"] = {symAt[{o1, o2}, {o1, o2}] === {0, 0, 0}, With[{pa = symAt[{o1, o2}, {o1, p2}]}, {pa[[1]] === 0, pa[[3]] === 0, pa[[2]] =!= 0}], With[{pa = symAt[{o1, o2}, {p1, o2}]}, {pa[[1]] =!= 0, pa[[2]] =!= 0, pa[[3]] =!= 0}]};\n(* per-weight ranks of phi_u over the grid (exact) *)\nphiGrid = Table[phiUof[phiP, pt[[1]], pt[[2]]], {pt, omGrid}];\nphiGridC = Table[phiUof[phiC, pt[[1]], pt[[2]]], {pt, omGrid}];\nwtRanks = Table[{u12wts[[m]], u12dims[[m]], MatrixRank[phiGrid[[All, u12idx[[m]]]]], MatrixRank[phiGridC[[All, u12idx[[m]]]]]}, {m, Length[u12wts]}];\nck[\"per-weight rank of phi_u over the 24-point grid {weight, dim, rank (phi), rank (phi')}: rank = multiplicity everywhere\"] = wtRanks;\nck[\"all slice weights reached with full rank (CG-complete)\"] = And @@ (#[[3]] == #[[2]] & /@ Select[wtRanks, MemberQ[hwSecs - Table[Λ, {Length[hwSecs]}], #[[1]]] &]);\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s): undo, symbolic\", N[{tUndo, tSym}, 3]}, {\"a' (closed form)\", ToString[aS, InputForm]}, {\"c'\", ToString[cS, InputForm]}, {\"g' = b' - a'c'\", ToString[gS, InputForm]}}, List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
