   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in the shared kernel; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| `time (s): undo, symbolic` | `{0.0087638, 0.01261}` |\n| `a' (closed form)` | `-(((-f1 + f2)*(o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1)*(f2 - p1)))` |\n| `c'` | `((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2*f3*o1 + f2*f3*o2 - f2*o1*o2 - f3*o1*o2 - f2*f3*p1 + o1*o2*p1 - f2*f3*p2 + o1*o2*p2 + f2*p1*p2 + f3*p1*p2 - o1*p1*p2 - o2*p1*p2))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)*(f3 - p2))` |\n| `g' = b' - a'c'` | `-(((-f1 + f3)*(-f2 + f3)*(o1 - p1)*(o2 - p1))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f2 - p1)*(f3 - p1)))` |\n| `(a) exact undo on all HW kets at 9 points (P, P', 2 generic, 5 regime): {all equal, naive control differs}` | `{9, {{True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}}}` |\n| `(b) a', c', g' of n' (exact, symbolic; the Gaudin vacua are eps-free, so these ARE the leading coefficients) equal the XXX leading coefficients a'0, c'0, g'0 (exact difference = 0)` | `{True, True, True}` |\n| `T1 dependence: g' independent of omega2'; a' independent of omega2, omega2'; c' depends on all four` | `{True, True, True}` |\n| `(b) rank of the Jacobian of (om1, om2, om1', om2') -> (a', c', g') at 3 generic points` | `{3, 3, 3}` |\n| `controls: omega' = omega gives n' = 1 exactly; common omega1' = omega1: a' = g' = 0, c' != 0; common omega2' = omega2: (a', g' != 0)` | `{True, {True, True, True}, {True, True, True}}` |\n| `per-weight rank of phi_u over the 24-point grid {weight, dim, rank (phi), rank (phi')}: rank = multiplicity everywhere` | `{{{0, 1, 2}, 1, 1, 1}, {{0, 2, 1}, 1, 1, 1}, {{1, 0, 2}, 1, 1, 1}, {{1, 1, 1}, 2, 2, 2}, {{1, 2, 0}, 1, 1, 1}, {{2, 0, 1}, 1, 1, 1}, {{2, 1, 0}, 1, 1, 1}}` |\n| `all slice weights reached with full rank (CG-complete)` | `True` |\n\n**[3,1,0] run**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| `time (s): undo, symbolic` | `{0.0202089, 0.0150201}` |\n| `a' (closed form)` | `-(((-f1 + f2)*(o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1)*(f2 - p1)))` |\n| `c'` | `((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2*f3*o1 + f2*f3*o2 - f2*o1*o2 - f3*o1*o2 - f2*f3*p1 + o1*o2*p1 - f2*f3*p2 + o1*o2*p2 + f2*p1*p2 + f3*p1*p2 - o1*p1*p2 - o2*p1*p2))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)*(f3 - p2))` |\n| `g' = b' - a'c'` | `-(((-f1 + f3)*(-f2 + f3)*(o1 - p1)*(o2 - p1))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f2 - p1)*(f3 - p1)))` |\n| `(a) exact undo on all HW kets at 9 points (P, P', 2 generic, 5 regime): {all equal, naive control differs}` | `{9, {{True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}}}` |\n| `(b) a', c', g' of n' (exact, symbolic; the Gaudin vacua are eps-free, so these ARE the leading coefficients) equal the XXX leading coefficients a'0, c'0, g'0 (exact difference = 0)` | `{True, True, True}` |\n| `T1 dependence: g' independent of omega2'; a' independent of omega2, omega2'; c' depends on all four` | `{True, True, True}` |\n| `(b) rank of the Jacobian of (om1, om2, om1', om2') -> (a', c', g') at 3 generic points` | `{3, 3, 3}` |\n| `controls: omega' = omega gives n' = 1 exactly; common omega1' = omega1: a' = g' = 0, c' != 0; common omega2' = omega2: (a', g' != 0)` | `{True, {True, True, True}, {True, True, True}}` |\n| `per-weight rank of phi_u over the 24-point grid {weight, dim, rank (phi), rank (phi')}: rank = multiplicity everywhere` | `{{{0, 1, 3}, 1, 1, 1}, {{0, 2, 2}, 1, 1, 1}, {{0, 3, 1}, 1, 1, 1}, {{1, 0, 3}, 1, 1, 1}, {{1, 1, 2}, 2, 2, 2}, {{1, 2, 1}, 2, 2, 2}, {{1, 3, 0}, 1, 1, 1}, {{2, 0, 2}, 1, 1, 1}, {{2, 1, 1}, 2, 2, 2}, {{2, 2, 0}, 1, 1, 1}, {{3, 0, 1}, 1, 1, 1}, {{3, 1, 0}, 1, 1, 1}}` |\n| `all slice weights reached with full rank (CG-complete)` | `True` |",
