 `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `4.18e-6, 8.36e-6, 1.67e-5` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 193)` |\n|  | `{4, 3, 1}` | `2` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `3.28e-6, 6.56e-6, 1.31e-5` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 193)` |\n|  | `{4, 2, 2}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `3.12e-6, 6.24e-6, 1.25e-5` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 194)` |\n|  | `{3, 3, 2}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `7.66e-6, 1.53e-5, 3.06e-5` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 192)` |\n| `CONTROL omega' = (7/4,-2/5) fixed (6 points)` |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | `{6, 2, 0}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `K=0` | `0` | `-` | `0 (acc 199)` |\n|  | `{6, 1, 1}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `6.91e-6, 1.38e-5, 2.76e-5` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 198)` |\n|  | `{5, 3, 0}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `3.74e-7, 7.49e-7, 1.5e-6` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 199)` |\n|  | `{5, 2, 1}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `5.58e-7, 1.12e-6, 2.23e-6` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 196)` |\n|  | `{5, 2, 1}` | `2` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.001}` | `4.03e-7, 8.06e-7, 1.61e-6` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 196)` |\n|  | `{4, 4, 0}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `1.5e-6, 2.99e-6, 5.99e-6` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 198)` |\n|  | `{4, 3, 1}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `1.09e-6, 2.18e-6, 4.36e-6` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 194)` |\n|  | `{4, 3, 1}` | `2` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `1.11e-6, 2.22e-6, 4.44e-6` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 194)` |\n|  | `{4, 2, 2}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `8.95e-7, 1.79e-6, 3.58e-6` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 195)` |\n|  | `{3, 3, 2}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `2.02e-6, 4.03e-6, 8.07e-6` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 194)` |\n| `CONTROL common omega1' = omega1 (12 points)` |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | `{6, 2, 0}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `K=0` | `0` | `-` | `0 (acc 199)` |\n|  | `{6, 1, 1}` | `1` | `{0., 0.}` | `{1., 1.}` | `2.67e-7, 5.34e-7, 1.07e-6` | `2.000, 2.000` | `0 (acc 199)` |\n|  | `{5, 3, 0}` | `1` | `not read` |  |  |  |  |\n|  | `{5, 2, 1}` | `1` | `not read` |  |  |  |  |\n|  | `{5, 2, 1}` | `2` | `not read` |  |  |  |  |\n|  | `{4, 4, 0}` | `1` | `not read` |  |  |  |  |\n|  | `{4, 3, 1}` | `1` | `not read` |  |  |  |  |\n|  | `{4, 3, 1}` | `2` | `not read` |  |  |  |  |\n|  | `{4, 2, 2}` | `1` | `not read` |  |  |  |  |\n|  | `{3, 3, 2}` | `1` | `not read` |  |  |  |  |\n| `MAIN family with phi' (24 points, eps = 1e-6 only)` |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | `{6, 2, 0}` | `1` | `-` | `K=0` | `0` | `-` | `0 (acc 199)` |\n|  | `{6, 1, 1}` | `1` | `-` | `-` | `8.71e-7` | `-` | `0 (acc 198)` |\n|  | `{5, 3, 0}` | `1` | `-` | `-` | `1.15e-6` | `-` | `0 (acc 198)` |\n|  | `{5, 2, 1}` | `1` | `-` | `-` | `2.61e-6` | `-` | `0 (acc 195)` |\n|  | `{5, 2, 1}` | `2` | `-` | `-` | `1.18e-6` | `-` | `0 (acc 196)` |\n|  | `{4, 4, 0}` | `1` | `-` | `-` | `4.59e-6` | `-` | `0 (acc 197)` |\n|  | `{4, 3, 1}` | `1` | `-` | `-` | `4.34e-6` | `-` | `0 (acc 193)` |\n|  | `{4, 3, 1}` | `2` | `-` | `-` | `3.1e-6` | `-` | `0 (acc 194)` |\n|  | `{4, 2, 2}` | `1` | `-` | `-` | `3.11e-6` | `-` | `0 (acc 195)` |\n|  | `{3, 3, 2}` | `1` | `-` | `-` | `7.55e-6` | `-` | `0 (acc 193)` |\n| `main family: K/S = O(eps) for every branch` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `time (s): one point, main (72 pts), fixed, common1, phi'` | `{0.0038834, 0.0885967, 0.0228147, 0.0379845, 0.3339042}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
