`1.59e-6, 6.34e-6` | `2.02e-6, 4.03e-6, 8.07e-6` | `4.00` | `{-0.02282177322938192139404040761670008891'10.}` | `{-0.02282177322938192138220437746649528853'10.}` | `5.19e-19` | `2.42e-25` |\n| `phi_u(main, all 24 points) = coverG[{a', g', c'}] with the closed forms of 4(b) (exact)` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `control omega' fixed: eps -> 0 limit of phi_u finite (no poles at ep = 0) and per-weight ranks over 6 directions {weight, dim, rank}` | `{True, {{{0, 1, 3}, 1, 1}, {{0, 2, 2}, 1, 1}, {{0, 3, 1}, 1, 1}, {{1, 0, 3}, 1, 1}, {{1, 1, 2}, 2, 2}, {{1, 2, 1}, 2, 2}, {{1, 3, 0}, 1, 1}, {{2, 0, 2}, 1, 1}, {{2, 1, 1}, 2, 2}, {{2, 2, 0}, 1, 1}, {{3, 0, 1}, 1, 1}, {{3, 1, 0}, 1, 1}}}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `u = e1 E13 and u' = e1 E23 E12 are supported on the weight Lambda+(-1,0,1) slice: supports vs idxOf[{1,1,1}]` | `{{4, 5}, {4}, {4, 5}}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `mixing R_c = (u.C_c)/(u'.C_c): {mu, copy}` | `exact copy` | `overlap Richardson` | `chain Richardson` | `rel dev overlap` | `rel dev chain` |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{5, 2, 1}, 1}` | `4.31173769149` | `4.31173769149` | `4.31173769149` | `5.02e-19` | `1.24e-20` |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{5, 2, 1}, 2}` | `-0.811737691490` | `-0.811737691490` | `-0.811737691490` | `2.31e-20` | `-2.33e-21` |  |  |  |  |\n| `time (s) main CG` | `0.1169171` |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
