  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Task 4(f). Overlaps for the Q side",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 4(f) and the Task 2 reference overlaps, for the Q side. At one grid point (omega, omega') = ((3/4,-1/5), (-12/5,1/8)) and eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6: the four overlaps <Om_w (x) Om_w|Psi>, <Om_w' (x) Om_w'|Psi>, <Om_w (x) Om_w'|Psi>, <Om_w' (x) Om_w|Psi> for the G-normalised HW-limit branches with their eps-exponents (the Gaudin vacua are eps-free, so O(1) overlaps are expected, exponent 0), and the reference-vacuum overlap <ΩD[zeta,omega0] (x) ΩD[zeta,omega0]|Psi> with omega0 = eps (2/5, 1/7). *)\nck = <||>;\npt5 = {{3/4, -1/5}, {-12/5, 1/8}};\nquant4[ie_] := Module[{eps = epsL[[ie]], zz = epsL[[ie]] phiP, B = Bs[[ie]], wv, wpv, w0, ov},\n  wv = eps pt5[[1]]; wpv = eps pt5[[2]]; w0 = eps {2/5, 1/7};\n  ov = Function[{a, b}, kron[N[ΩD[zz, a], pr], N[ΩD[zz, b], pr]]];\n  Table[With[{psi = brOf[B, hwListG[[ib, 1]], hwListG[[ib, 2]]][\"psi\"]}, {ov[wv, wv] . psi, ov[wpv, wpv] . psi, ov[wv, wpv] . psi, ov[wpv, wv] . psi, ov[w0, w0] . psi}], {ib, nb}]];\n{tQ4, q4} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[quant4[ie], {ie, 3}]];\nfmtC[x_] := If[x == 0, \"0\", With[{e = Floor[Log10[Abs[x]]]}, ToString[Round[x/10^e, 0.001]] <> \"e\" <> ToString[e]]];\nexpoQ = Table[Table[If[q4[[1, ib, k]] == 0 || q4[[2, ib, k]] == 0, \"-\", Round[Log[Abs[q4[[2, ib, k]]/q4[[1, ib, k]]]]/Log[2], 0.001]], {k, 5}], {ib, nb}];\nck[\"all overlaps real (max |Im|/|value|)\"] = sz[Max[Table[Abs[Im[x]]/Abs[x], {x, Flatten[q4]}] /. Indeterminate -> 0]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"mu\", \"copy\", \"<w w|Psi> eps=1e-6\", \"<w' w'|Psi>\", \"<w w'|Psi>\", \"<w' w|Psi>\", \"<w0 w0|Psi> (w0 = eps(2/5,1/7))\", \"eps-exponents (1e-6 -> 2e-6): ww, pp, wp, pw, w0w0\"}}, Table[{hwListG[[ib, 1]], hwListG[[ib, 2]], fmtC[q4[[1, ib, 1]]], fmtC[q4[[1, ib, 2]]], fmtC[q4[[1, ib, 3]]], fmtC[q4[[1, ib, 4]]], fmtC[q4[[1, ib, 5]]], ToString[expoQ[[ib]]]}, {ib, nb}], {{\"same at eps = 4e-6: <w w|Psi> ... <w0 w0|Psi>\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, Table[{hwListG[[ib, 1]], hwListG[[ib, 2]], fmtC[q4[[3, ib, 1]]], fmtC[q4[[3, ib, 2]]], fmtC[q4[[3, ib, 3]]], fmtC[q4[[3, ib, 4]]], fmtC[q4[[3, ib, 5]]], \"\"}, {ib, nb}], {{\"time (s)\", N[tQ4, 3], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
