  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Cross-check against the independent Python results (P1 Q side, P2 XXX-limit; predicted localiser from the h-expansion of T_(1,1)(theta1 - 2h)) at [2,1,0], P = (zeta, omega) = ((3/2,5/4,2/3), (5/2,7/3,3/5)), theta = (2/7,-3/5). (i) S3 has no triple pole, S2 double pole = 3, S_k(infinity) = e_k(zeta); (ii) the vacuum S2 eigenvalue function and the double poles 9/5 (omega), 27/7 (omega'); (iii) X1 = -(4631/124) id + 3 H1 - S3c[1,2] satisfies <Om(x)Om|X1 = u (x) Om1 with u = Om1.(431/62 - 3 C_zeta - S3^{1-site}[-2]). Constants are for this point only; only meaningful for Lambda = {2,1,0}. *)\nck = <||>;\nIf[Λ === {2, 1, 0},\n Module[{LA2 = laurent[DiagonalMatrix[zP], thN], gp = gpVar[1][zP, wP], gpp = gpVar[1][zP, wpP], Lg, Lp, O2, O2p, ev, e2z, e3z, f, os, Om1, X1, Phi, uu},\n  e2z = zP[[1]] zP[[2]] + zP[[1]] zP[[3]] + zP[[2]] zP[[3]]; e3z = Times @@ zP; Lg = laurent[gp, thN]; Lp = laurent[gpp, thN]; O2 = Om2[zP, wP]; O2p = Om2[zP, wpP];\n  ev[O_, A_] := With[{c = O . A}, c[[1]]/O[[1]]]; f[u_] := 131/15 + (12539/930)/(u - thN[[1]]) + 3/(u - thN[[1]])^2 + (4139/930)/(u - thN[[2]]) + 3/(u - thN[[2]])^2;\n  ck[\"(i) S3 triple-pole coefficients are exactly 0 (s=1,2); S2 double poles; S2(inf), e2; S3(inf), e3\"] = {Table[zeroQ[LA2[\"S3c\"][{s, 3}]], {s, 2}], Table[Normal[LA2[\"S2dbl\"][[s]]][[1, 1]], {s, 2}], {Normal[LA2[\"S2inf\"]][[1, 1]], e2z}, {Normal[LA2[\"S3inf\"]][[1, 1]], e3z}};\n  ck[\"(ii) vacuum S2 eigenvalue = 131/15 + (12539/930)/(u-th1) + 3/(u-th1)^2 + (4139/930)/(u-th2) + 3/(u-th2)^2 at u0,u1,u2 (difference)\"] = Table[ev[O2, Sk[2][gp, thN, u]] - f[u], {u, {u0, u1, u2}}];\n  ck[\"(ii) vacuum S3 double-pole eigenvalues: (th1: omega, omega'), (th2: omega, omega')  [coordinator: 9/5, 27/7]\"] = {ev[O2, Lg[\"S3c\"][{1, 2}]], ev[O2p, Lp[\"S3c\"][{1, 2}]], ev[O2, Lg[\"S3c\"][{2, 2}]], ev[O2p, Lp[\"S3c\"][{2, 2}]]};\n  os = oneSiteOps[zP, wP, thN[[1]]]; Om1 = ΩD[zP, wP[[1 ;; 2]]];\n  X1 = -(4631/124) id2 + 3 laurent[DiagonalMatrix[zP], thN][\"Hres\"][[1]] - laurent[DiagonalMatrix[zP], thN][\"S3c\"][{1, 2}];\n  Phi = Partition[kron[Om1, Om1] . X1, d1]; uu = Om1 . (431/62 id1 - 3 os[\"ops\"][[2]] - os[\"ops\"][[4]]);\n  ck[\"(iii) <Om(x)Om|X1 = u (x) Om1 exactly with u = Om1.(431/62 - 3 C_zeta - S3^{1-site}[-2]) (X1 = -4631/124 id + 3 H1 - S3c[1,2])\"] = Phi === Outer[Times, uu, Om1]]];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"check\", \"result\"}}, List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
