   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in the shared kernel; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| `check` | `result` |\n| `(i) S3 triple-pole coefficients are exactly 0 (s=1,2); S2 double poles; S2(inf), e2; S3(inf), e3` | `{{True, True}, {3, 3}, {89/24, 89/24}, {5/4, 5/4}}` |\n| `(ii) vacuum S2 eigenvalue = 131/15 + (12539/930)/(u-th1) + 3/(u-th1)^2 + (4139/930)/(u-th2) + 3/(u-th2)^2 at u0,u1,u2 (difference)` | `{0, 0, 0}` |\n| `(ii) vacuum S3 double-pole eigenvalues: (th1: omega, omega'), (th2: omega, omega')  [coordinator: 9/5, 27/7]` | `{9/5, 27/7, 9/5, 27/7}` |\n| `(iii) <Om(x)Om\\|X1 = u (x) Om1 exactly with u = Om1.(431/62 - 3 C_zeta - S3^{1-site}[-2]) (X1 = -4631/124 id + 3 H1 - S3c[1,2])` | `True` |",
